{# Modal de saisie d'une énigme, piloté par riddle-manager.js. Les champs n'ont pas de
   name : ils ne sont jamais soumis tels quels, le script en construit la charge utile. #}
<div id="riddle_modal" class="hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black bg-opacity-50 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl max-w-3xl w-full max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
        <div class="sticky top-0 bg-white border-b border-gray-200 px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-t-2xl">
            <h3 id="riddle_modal_title" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Ajouter une énigme</h3>
            <button type="button" id="close_riddle_modal" class="text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600 transition" aria-label="Fermer">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>

        <form id="riddle_form" class="p-6 space-y-6" onsubmit="return false;">
            <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                    <label for="riddle_title" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Titre de l'énigme <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="riddle_title" required maxlength="20" placeholder="Ex : Trouve le monument"
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">20 caractères maximum</p>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="riddle_description" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Énoncé <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                    <textarea id="riddle_description" required maxlength="1000" rows="4" placeholder="Décrivez l'énigme que les joueurs devront résoudre..."
                              class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition resize-none"></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div>
                        <label for="riddle_type" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Type <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                        <select id="riddle_type" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition cursor-pointer">
                            <option value="text">Réponse texte</option>
                            <option value="gps">Localisation GPS</option>
                            <option value="mcq">QCM</option>
                            <option value="qr">QR Code</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="riddle_difficulty" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Difficulté <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                        <select id="riddle_difficulty" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition cursor-pointer">
                            <option value="1">Facile</option>
                            <option value="2" selected>Moyen</option>
                            <option value="3">Difficile</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label for="riddle_max_attempts" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-2">Essais notés <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                        <input type="number" id="riddle_max_attempts" required min="1" max="20" step="1" value="3"
                               class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">De 1 à 20. Au-delà, le joueur peut encore répondre mais ne marque plus de points.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="text_fields" class="riddle-type-fields space-y-4">
                <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <label for="text_answer" class="block font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Réponse attendue <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="text_answer" maxlength="100" placeholder="La réponse correcte"
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">La comparaison ignore la casse, les accents et les espaces superflus.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="gps_fields" class="riddle-type-fields hidden space-y-4">
                <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Coordonnées de la cible <span class="text-red-500">*</span></h4>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                        <div>
                            <label for="gps_latitude" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Latitude</label>
                            <input type="number" id="gps_latitude" step="0.000001" min="-90" max="90" placeholder="49.253700"
                                   class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label for="gps_longitude" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1">Longitude</label>
                            <input type="number" id="gps_longitude" step="0.000001" min="-180" max="180" placeholder="4.034000"
                                   class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Le joueur valide l'énigme à moins de 50 mètres de ce point.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="mcq_fields" class="riddle-type-fields hidden space-y-4">
                <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-200 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
                        <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-800">Choix proposés <span class="text-red-500">*</span></h4>
                        <button type="button" id="add_mcq_choice" class="text-sm bg-yellow-600 hover:bg-yellow-700 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-lg transition">+ Ajouter un choix</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-3">Cochez la ou les bonnes réponses. Plus il y a de choix, moins l'énigme se devine.</p>
                    <div id="mcq_choices_container" class="space-y-2"></div>
                    <label class="mt-4 flex items-center space-x-3 cursor-pointer">
                        <input type="checkbox" id="mcq_reveal_count" checked class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 border-gray-300 rounded focus:ring-green-500" />
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-700">Annoncer au joueur le nombre de bonnes réponses attendues</span>
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="qr_fields" class="riddle-type-fields hidden space-y-4">
                <div class="bg-purple-50 border border-purple-200 rounded-xl p-4">
                    <label for="qr_code" class="block font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-3">Contenu du QR code <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
                    <input type="text" id="qr_code" maxlength="20" placeholder="CODE123"
                           class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-purple-500 focus:border-transparent transition" />
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Le texte encodé dans le QR code que les joueurs devront scanner, 20 caractères maximum.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center justify-end space-x-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
                <button type="button" id="close_riddle_modal_btn" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-100 transition">Annuler</button>
                <button type="button" id="save_riddle_btn" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-indigo-700 hover:from-purple-700 hover:to-indigo-800 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl shadow-lg transform transition hover:scale-105">Enregistrer l'énigme</button>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
